WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:04.401
Every row in Settings, Keymap now has an Unbind button.

00:04.401 --> 00:07.728
The row reads Unbound. Nothing fires the action until it gets a key again.

00:07.728 --> 00:10.552
⇧⌘P used to open the command palette. Now it does nothing.

00:10.552 --> 00:16.209
Vim users: :unbind takes a key away from the ex line.

00:16.209 --> 00:20.588
The leader hints drop the unbound action: no more o for open buffers.

00:20.588 --> 00:23.989
It travels with your dotfiles: "vim.leaderOpenBuffers" = "" under [keymaps] in config.toml.

00:23.989 --> 00:30.161
Reset brings the shipped default back.
